      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "By evening at Claude Monet, an exhausted Denis shows German the two peeled sacks of potatoes, only for German to claim he actually ordered twenty sacks. Listen to their Russian conversation first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "german",
      "t": "Вы же почистили только два мешка.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "denis",
      "t": "Ну да, как вы и сказали.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
